%% REPL / context growth — for Marp (exported PNG)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant You
    participant App as Chat App (claude.ai, ChatGPT, Gemini, …)
    participant LLM as LLM

    Note over App,LLM: System Prompt is prepended to every call

    You->>App: User Prompt 1
    App->>LLM: [System] + [User 1]
    LLM-->>App: Answer 1
    App-->>You: Answer 1

    You->>App: User Prompt 2
    App->>LLM: [System] + [User 1] + [Answer 1] + [User 2]
    LLM-->>App: Answer 2
    App-->>You: Answer 2

    You->>App: User Prompt 3
    App->>LLM: [System] + [User 1] + [Answer 1] + [User 2] + [Answer 2] + [User 3]
    LLM-->>App: Answer 3
    App-->>You: Answer 3
